"""Thirty authored opportunities, sixty decisions, six consequence-gated returns."""
# location, title/en, premise/en, skill A/B, action A/en, result A/en, later A/en, action B/en,result B/en,later B/en
AFFAIRS=[
(1,'桥下第一根铁销','The First Bridge Pin','桥工发现下游支座松了，修桥资金与通行安排都需要有人跑一趟。','A downstream support is loose; funding and access both need attention.','forge','parley','带铁料帮桥工更换支销','Bring iron and help replace the pin','桥工量过尺寸后与你完成更换，通行暂未中断。','The crew measures and replaces the pin with you without closing the bridge.','桥工准备请过路车主共同承担下一段维修，而不是永远等一个外客。','The crew plans shared funding for the next repair rather than relying forever on a visitor.','协调临时限载与修桥时段','Negotiate a load limit and repair window','车主同意分批通行，工人有了安稳检修的空档。','Wagon owners accept staggered crossings, giving workers a safe inspection window.','商队开始按新的时段排队，小车主希望下次也能参加商议。','Caravans queue under the new schedule; smaller owners ask to join future discussions.'),
(2,'没有写进账的热汤','Soup Off the Ledger','客栈掌柜与磨坊的欠账影响桥工晚饭，双方都不愿在客人面前争吵。','An inn debt threatens workers’ supper; neither party wants a public quarrel.','ledger','parley','核对已送面粉和已有还款','Compare flour deliveries with payments','你找出一笔被重复登记的运费，双方按实物与旧收条重算。','You identify a duplicated freight charge and reconcile receipts with deliveries.','磨坊仍需收回余款，掌柜也开始另记免单，不把善意当成凭空粮食。','The remaining debt stands; free meals get their own record rather than becoming imaginary food.','自付一份应急粮，给双方留商议余地','Buy emergency grain while they negotiate','厨房照常开火，欠账并未被你这一份粮食抹掉。','The kitchen stays open; one grain purchase does not erase the debt.','受助桥工愿意在休工时修磨坊门板，新的交换要重新说定。','Workers offer to repair the mill door off shift; the new exchange needs its own agreement.'),
(3,'重复的旧税票','Duplicate Toll Receipts','两车粮持同一编号，关吏没有足够证据扣下任何一车。','Two grain wagons share a receipt number; the clerk lacks grounds to seize either.','ledger','witness','比较两份票据的经手次序','Compare the chain of handlers','旧账副显示是换班时误抄编号，税额仍须逐车核实。','The copy shows a shift-change numbering error; each tax amount still needs checking.','关吏改为在交接页签名，一位曾被怀疑的车主愿意再来作证。','Clerks begin signing handovers; a wrongly suspected owner will testify again.','请两名车主共同留样并继续送粮','Take agreed copies and let grain move','两名车主留下可追溯副本，粮车没有为证据不足的指控停运。','Both owners leave traceable copies, avoiding detention on an unsupported accusation.','粮送到后，收货人能补上另一段交接证言。','Recipients can later complete the chain of custody.'),
(4,'漂木与鱼汛','Timber and the Fish Run','渡工想接运木，渔户担心堵鱼，两边都只见过河的一段。','Ferry crews seek timber work while fishers fear blocked runs; each knows only part of the river.','survey','parley','查浅滩并标出不堵水的系木处','Survey the shoal and mark a clear mooring','你找到可分批系木的位置，需船户照标记实际操作。','You mark a staggered mooring site that crews must actually use.','渔户带来这一轮鱼获记录，后续能比较而不是继续猜。','Fishers bring catch records so the next discussion can compare evidence.','谈成小批试运并邀请渔户观察','Arrange a limited trial with fishers watching','双方只同意一次小批试运，没有交出全部水面。','Both agree to one limited trial, not surrender the whole river.','试运者要说明自己看到的结果，未到场的人不会自动知道。','Participants must report their observations; absent people do not automatically learn them.'),
(5,'灰烬田的闸口','Ash Field Sluice','两户共用水渠都说自己先缺水，裂开的闸板已经关不严。','Two farms dispute priority while a cracked sluice no longer closes.','forge','parley','用木料和铁件修闸','Repair the gate with timber and iron','闸板重新能关紧，分水时段仍需两家谈妥。','The gate closes again, though sharing hours still need agreement.','田里新作物开始发芽，退伍兵想请人教孩子修工具。','Seedlings emerge; the veteran asks about teaching his child tool repair.','对照田况商议轮流放水','Compare fields and negotiate alternating flow','两户在田边定下短期轮流安排，没有把下一季也替别人决定。','They agree a short-term rotation without deciding next season for others.','轮值遇到暴雨后要重议，旧约可以按新事实调整。','Heavy rain will require reconsideration; agreements can adapt to new facts.'),
(6,'雨中的未送信','The Undelivered Rain Letter','驿站找到一封受潮信，收件地址只写了旧村名。','A rain-soaked letter names only a village that no longer exists.','lore','parley','核对旧路图寻找今名','Match old maps to the present name','旧路图与信封上的小桥记号对上了，信仍未送到本人手里。','The map matches a bridge mark; the letter has not yet reached its recipient.','信使可以沿已核地址安排递送，回信需另等真实行程。','A courier can use the verified address; any answer needs its own journey.','向失土者询问村名，不拆信','Ask displaced residents without opening it','有人认出故乡旧称，愿意提供一位可能知道去处的联系人。','A resident recognizes the old name and offers a relevant contact.','被询问的人会担心寻人缘由，再见时需要解释而非默认信任。','The resident remains concerned about the search’s purpose; future trust needs explanation.'),
(7,'一堡两份冬粮','Two Winters in One Keep','骑士团的运粮车到了，军户认为分配表漏了伤残者家属。','The order’s grain wagon arrives; military families say dependents were omitted.','ledger','parley','核对人数与储粮实数','Compare household counts and real stores','你指出漏记的一户和无法同时满足的缺口，没有许诺不存在的粮。','You identify an omitted household and a real shortfall without promising nonexistent grain.','书记请两边各留一人参与下一次清点。','The clerk invites one delegate from each side to the next count.','协调暂借公共粮，不签长期效忠','Arrange a temporary shared loan without an oath','团方与军户明确借多少、何时再谈，帮助不等于入团。','Both specify the temporary amount and review date; aid is not enlistment.','借粮方按约准备答复，改变的是一笔具体关系而非全境好感。','Borrowers prepare a reply; one relationship changes, not universal reputation.'),
(8,'先学会停手','Learn to Stop','教头要新兵练停手信号，一位新兵觉得这会显得胆怯。','An instructor teaches a stop signal that a recruit calls cowardly.','shield','parley','参加一次明确非致命练习','Join an explicitly nonlethal lesson','你按信号收势，让新兵看到留手需要的控制。','You stop on signal, demonstrating the control restraint requires.','新兵愿意先把架势练稳，之后的正式切磋仍要双方同意。','The recruit accepts more stance practice; later sparring still needs consent.','听他说明逞强的原因','Hear why he needs to look brave','他承认担心家人以为自己没用，教头答应给他别的责任。','He fears disappointing his family; the instructor offers another responsibility.','他开始帮忙检查训练木剑，勇气有了不只一种表达。','He begins checking practice swords; courage gains another expression.'),
(9,'家书上的空名字','The Blank Name on a Letter','礼拜堂的无名家书可能对应一名死者，书记不愿草率认亲。','An unsigned letter may identify a dead soldier; the clerk refuses a careless match.','witness','firstaid','比对亲历者证言与衣物','Compare witness accounts and clothing','两段证言对上了修补位置，但还不足以确认全名。','Two accounts match a mend in the clothing, but not yet the complete name.','亲属被告知确认与不确定的部分，决定是否继续寻找。','Relatives hear both certainty and doubt and decide whether to continue.','先帮照顾等候的家属','Care for the waiting relatives first','你提供实际药布和照料，辨认程序没有因此被省略。','You provide dressings and care without bypassing identification.','家属记得你的帮助，却仍有自己的哀伤与选择。','They remember the help while retaining their grief and choices.'),
(11,'越过草场的线','Across the Pasture Line','军需与牧群的界桩倒了，倒桩本身无法证明谁先越界。','A boundary post has fallen; that alone proves no trespass.','survey','parley','查旧桩穴和牲畜足印','Inspect the old socket and hoofprints','雨水冲塌了桩穴，后来确有两边牲畜经过，顺序仍不完全清楚。','Rain undermined the socket and both herds passed later; the sequence remains partly unclear.','双方改在稳定地段补标，愿意交换病畜照料办法。','Both remark stable ground and exchange animal-care advice.','先议一块共享短期草地','Negotiate a temporary shared patch','两边划出可共用的草地，争议界线留待证据齐备再谈。','They share a limited patch while postponing the disputed boundary.','草地使用带来新的实际观察，旧指责不必一直决定关系。','Shared use yields new observations rather than letting old accusations rule forever.'),
(13,'谁听见了钟','Who Heard the Bell','采药人与樵夫对夜间声音各有解释，两条路线交会在低洼地。','Herbalist and woodcutter explain a sound differently; their routes cross in low ground.','trail','lore','沿已知路线查水与回声','Follow the known routes and test water echoes','你找到水击空铜的可能位置，尚不能断言那就是每次钟声。','You find water striking hollow bronze, not proof of every reported bell.','两人愿意共同记录下一次声音的时刻与风向。','Both agree to record the next sound’s time and wind.','比较旧林记而不先判谁撒谎','Compare forest records without accusing either','旧记录说明沉钟不止一口，两份说法未必互斥。','Old records describe multiple bells; the accounts need not conflict.','守林人愿意开放一段普通旧图，深处遗址仍需另行准备。','Keepers share a mundane map section; deeper ruins still need preparation.'),
(14,'活根与石桥','Living Root, Stone Bridge','根桥病变，外来石匠的加固建议触动守林者的旧伤。','A sick rootbridge and an outsider mason’s repair plan reopen old wounds.','herbwise','forge','取病根小样并保留活根','Take a small sample while preserving the root','样本显示局部腐损，你提出先减载和清理积水。','A sample shows local decay; you propose lower loads and drainage first.','石匠与守林者愿意一起查看恢复情况，没人提前保证痊愈。','Mason and keepers inspect recovery together without a promised cure.','做可拆支架，不砍主根','Build removable supports without cutting the root','支架接住负荷，主根留在原处，双方能继续观察。','Supports bear weight while the root remains for observation.','聚落开始讨论由谁维护支架，而非把修好当成永远结束。','Residents discuss maintenance rather than treating one repair as a permanent ending.'),
(15,'泉水不是罪名','A Sample, Not an Accusation','泉水混浊，指向矿城的传闻已比实际样本传得更远。','Cloudy spring water has produced accusations faster than samples.','herbwise','survey','按地点封存水样','Seal samples with their collection sites','你按上下游分别取样，标签能支持比较，不能直接定罪。','You label upstream and downstream samples for comparison, not conviction.','矿工与守林者有了可共同复核的材料。','Miners and keepers now have material they can examine together.','勘查暴雨后的支流泥沙','Survey sediment after the storm','一条自然滑坡支流也带入泥沙，污染来源可能不只一处。','A naturally slipped tributary contributes sediment; there may be multiple sources.','调查避免了立即封死矿井，但实际排水问题仍待解决。','An immediate total mine closure is avoided; drainage problems remain.'),
(16,'二手铜钮','The Secondhand Button','旧铜钮被认作失窃家物，卖主拿得出自己的购货收条。','A button is claimed as stolen property; the seller has a purchase receipt.','ledger','parley','沿收条追查转手过程','Trace its chain through receipts','收条连到一名搬家清物的亲属，财物是否获准出售仍须问本人。','The chain reaches a relative clearing a house; authority to sell still needs checking.','两家愿意等来信而非当街动手。','Both families await a letter rather than fight in public.','促成暂存与双方留名','Arrange temporary safekeeping with both names','铜钮由双方同意的人暂存，没人因此自动丢钱或获利。','An agreed holder keeps the button; no one automatically gains or loses money.','后续取回或补偿要依据新确认的事实。','Return or compensation will depend on later verified facts.'),
(17,'钟铜与沼路','Bell Bronze and Marsh Roads','拆钟者说需要铜钱修路，守林者担心钟体支撑着木栈。','Salvagers want bronze money for a road; keepers fear the bell supports the walkway.','survey','forge','先测栈道承重并标危险段','Survey supports and mark the danger','你找出受力支点，确认不能直接把整圈铜沿切走。','You identify load-bearing points that prevent cutting away the whole rim.','拆钟者改谈少量松脱铜片，修路仍需找别的来源。','Salvagers discuss loose fragments instead; road funding remains incomplete.','带木料加固一段过水路','Bring timber to reinforce one wet crossing','一段栈道稳住了，余下的沼地仍危险。','One walkway section is stable; the rest remains dangerous.','守林者愿意带路复查，但不会保证所有来客无风险。','A keeper offers a reinspection, not universal safety.'),
(19,'矿城的第一桶清水','Copperback’s First Clean Bucket','病房缺清水，矿主与工人争论先修泵还是先清沉池。','The clinic lacks clean water while owners and workers debate pump versus settling pool.','forge','herbwise','修泵并清理可见堵塞','Repair the pump and clear the visible blockage','泵恢复输水，水质仍需另查，不能把流得快当成干净。','The pump runs; flow is not proof of clean water.','工人开始收集水质记录，下一步维护有了证据。','Workers begin water records to guide maintenance.','给病房先做有限净水处理','Prepare a limited clean supply for the clinic','药草与净盐用于这一批水，长期供应仍没解决。','Herbs and salt treat this batch; long-term supply remains unresolved.','病房得到喘息时间，愿意参加下一次公共水源协商。','The clinic gains breathing room and joins the next water discussion.'),
(21,'风轮停不停','Should the Fan Stop','七号井风轮坏了，停产意味着少拿工钱，继续则有人可能撑不住。','Shaft Seven’s fan is broken; stopping costs wages and continuing risks workers.','forge','parley','带铁件修复风轮轴','Bring iron parts to repair the fan shaft','你在撤出人员后配合井工修轴，复工仍需复查。','After evacuation, you help repair the shaft; reopening needs inspection.','工人提出写清停工期间的实际工资安排。','Workers ask for a clear agreement on pay during closures.','支持暂封井并协调应急生活','Support closure and arrange emergency support','人先离井，损失被明确记录，没有用一顿饭当成全额补偿。','Workers leave first; losses are recorded rather than treating one meal as full compensation.','诸家需要面对工资问题，工人不必把救命者当永久领袖。','The houses must address pay; workers need not make their helper a permanent leader.'),
(23,'军刀还是犁铧','Swords or Ploughshares','工坊同一炉铁要交军单又要修春耕犁，两边都说误不得。','One furnace must meet a military order and repair ploughs; both claim urgency.','ledger','forge','按交货实况重排工期','Reschedule around actual delivery needs','可延后的军单与真正紧急的农具分开，客户需要逐一同意。','Deferrable military work is separated from urgent farm repairs, subject to customer agreement.','工坊让各方看到明确顺序，旧怨没有立刻消失。','Clients see a clear order; resentments do not instantly vanish.','自备材料补修两件常用工具','Bring material to repair everyday tools','你完成有限补修，没凭空增加整座工坊产量。','You complete a limited repair without magically multiplying the workshop’s output.','农户愿意提供粮食作为未来交换，数量仍需再谈。','Growers offer food for future work, with quantities still to negotiate.'),
(25,'封湖线内外','Inside the Lake Closure','湖区的封水告示写得含糊，学徒与渔户各按自己的理解行动。','A vague water closure leaves apprentices and fishers following different interpretations.','survey','parley','实测并清楚标注范围','Measure and mark the boundary clearly','危险取水区与可用渡道分开，不再靠整湖禁行一句带过。','Unsafe collection zones are separated from navigable crossings.','鱼市恢复部分往来，测量组需要继续解释新结果。','Some market traffic returns; surveyors must explain later findings.','组织双方当面核对需求','Bring both sides together over specific needs','学徒解释测试，渔户说明生计，短期安排得以形成。','Apprentices explain tests and fishers livelihoods, producing an interim agreement.','下一次变化将通过约定渠道通知，而不是全境瞬间知晓。','Future changes use agreed channels, not instant universal knowledge.'),
(26,'错了一格的星图','A Chart One Mark Off','观星塔旧抄本可能误了一格，承认错误会影响一位学者声誉。','An old chart may be one mark wrong; acknowledgment could damage a scholar’s standing.','lore','witness','比较观测与抄本的版本','Compare observations and copy versions','你定位到抄写偏差，不能因此认定所有旧航图都错。','You locate a copy error, not prove every old chart wrong.','塔方愿意更正相关页，海员需要实际收到修订本。','The tower agrees to correct affected pages; sailors must receive them.','请学者说明不确定处并暂发警示','Seek an uncertainty notice before full correction','学者同意注明待核区域，警示不带未经证实的指控。','The scholar marks the uncertain region without unsupported accusations.','公开承认有限未知，让部分船户愿意继续提供观测。','Acknowledging uncertainty persuades some crews to share observations.'),
(27,'捐纸的条件','The Terms of Donated Paper','书院有新纸可用，但捐助者要求排除某些学生。','New paper arrives with a demand that some students be excluded.','parley','forge','要求改为无排斥的共同资助','Seek joint funding without exclusion','你找到愿意分担的小额资助者，原捐助条件没有被偷偷接受。','Smaller sponsors share the need; the exclusionary terms were not silently accepted.','书院重新安排课程，各族学生仍需实际投入学习。','Lessons resume; students of every people still have to study.','修旧书板与笔具延长使用','Repair old boards and writing tools','旧工具恢复可用，缓解纸荒但未解决全部开支。','Old tools become useful again, easing rather than solving the shortage.','成年人学员提出轮流修理，帮助形成具体的新习惯。','Adult learners offer a repair rotation, creating a practical habit.'),
(31,'城门上写谁的名','Whose Name on the Gate','三家使者争修门署名，街坊等着堵住穿堂风。','Three envoys dispute a repair inscription while residents wait for drafts to stop.','forge','mediation','先修居民每天经过的门缝','Repair the gaps residents use daily','修补落到木石上，没有把政治承诺写进工钱收条。','Wood and stone are repaired without slipping political vows into wage receipts.','街坊更愿意讨论谁来长期维护，而不是谁先剪彩。','Residents turn toward maintenance rather than ceremonial credit.','把纪念牌与公共修缮分开商议','Separate commemorations from public repairs','各方同意先办共同工程，谁留名仍未定。','All accept the shared repair first; inscriptions remain unsettled.','使者对你的态度因各自利益不同，不会一齐臣服。','Envoys react according to their interests, not unanimous submission.'),
(32,'两份继承书','Two Inheritance Papers','档案院两份文书冲突，贸然认定会牵动仍住在旧地的人。','Conflicting inheritance papers affect families still living on the land.','witness','lore','查墨迹、保管与证言','Examine ink, custody and testimony','其中一份有后补段落，补写者和授权仍未完全确认。','One has a later passage whose writer and authority remain uncertain.','相关家庭得到已确认部分，不会突然被一纸结论赶走。','Families receive the verified findings rather than instant eviction.','先整理双方都承认的旧事实','Record the facts both sides accept','共同承认的界标与住户史被单独保留，争议不再混成一团。','Agreed landmarks and occupancy history are separated from disputed claims.','后续调停有了共同起点，但仍允许谈不拢。','Mediation gains a shared starting point without a guaranteed agreement.'),
(38,'换灯心还是留回声','A New Core or Old Echoes','古灯衰弱，航海安全与保存古代回声不能都靠空口保证。','The ancient beacon fades; navigation and old echoes cannot both be guaranteed by words.','beaconwork','lore','用可拆导件稳定现有灯心','Stabilize the core with removable guides','灯光暂稳，旧心未拆，下一次检查仍必要。','The beam steadies without removing the core; another inspection remains necessary.','船户愿意提供航行记录，守望者准备有限修护计划。','Crews offer navigation logs while keepers plan limited repairs.','先抄录已能辨认的回声与结构','Record readable echoes and structure first','记录保住已读部分，灯本身并没有因此修好。','Readable portions are preserved, but the beacon itself is not repaired.','航海者催问替代警示，学者必须面对等待的代价。','Sailors ask for alternate warnings; scholars confront the cost of delay.'),
(40,'名单上的名字','Names on the List','寻亲名单能帮人团聚，也会让躲避旧仇的人暴露。','A reunion list may also expose people fleeing old enemies.','parley','ledger','按当事人意愿保留联系中转','Keep contact through a consent-based intermediary','愿意公开与只愿中转的人被分别记录，没有替沉默者答应。','Public and mediated contacts are separated without treating silence as consent.','寻找者要通过中转请求联系，被寻者仍可拒绝。','Searchers request contact through the intermediary; the sought person may refuse.','核对重复与误写，不抄走整份名单','Check errors without copying the whole list','几处同音误写被纠正，完整住处仍由原持有人保管。','Name errors are corrected while full addresses remain with the original keeper.','一位寻亲者得到准确线索，其他人的资料没有一并公开。','One searcher gains a sound lead without exposing everyone else.'),
(1,'修桥之后的座位','Seats After the Repair','上一轮修桥已有结果，桥工想让小车主也参与下一轮安排。','The bridge repair has consequences; workers want small wagon owners included next time.','parley','ledger','邀请实际受影响者共同商议','Invite the people actually affected','参与者谈妥一小段修缮窗口，没有被强迫加入自由盟。','Those present agree a limited work window without forced League membership.','有人会守约，也有人需要解释迟到，后续以实际行为为准。','Some keep their word and others must explain delays; later actions matter.','把已付与未付费用说明白','Clarify what has and has not been paid','清楚的数额让争议缩小，但欠款不会被一段演说抹掉。','Clear amounts narrow the dispute without a speech erasing debt.','工人能据此决定接不接下一段工程。','Workers can decide whether to accept the next job.'),
(19,'清水下一程','The Next Clean Water Step','矿城已有一批水源记录，工人和守林者可对照实物再谈。','Copperback now has water records for miners and keepers to compare.','survey','parley','对照标记水样与排水口','Compare labeled samples with outlets','你排除了一处被误指的水口，留下仍需处理的来源。','You rule out one wrongly blamed outlet and retain unresolved sources.','双方愿意试一段小改造，效果还要后来观察。','Both agree to a small modification whose effect must be observed later.','让病房与井下工人说明急需','Hear urgent needs from clinic and miners','急需被分开排序，不让声音最大的人独占资源。','Needs are separately prioritized rather than awarded to the loudest voice.','各方会据兑现情况改变信任，而非因承诺立即满好感。','Trust changes with delivery, not instantly with promises.'),
(25,'更正后的航船','Ships After the Correction','星图已有更正或警示，仍需确认实际用图者收到哪一版。','Charts have a correction or warning; someone must verify which version crews actually use.','ledger','parley','核对三份船用抄本版本','Compare three working chart copies','你找出还未更新的一份，船家同意替换相关页。','One copy is outdated; its owner agrees to replace the affected pages.','海员愿意分享观测，但未到港的船还没有收到。','Crews share observations; ships not yet in port still lack the update.','请船户说明延误带来的损失','Hear crews’ losses from the delay','损失被记下，学者解释能承担的部分，双方没有伪装全部满意。','Losses are recorded and scholars state what they can cover, without pretending universal satisfaction.','新的往来依靠实际回信与协作，不是一场谈话解决所有旧怨。','Future correspondence and work, not one conversation, shape the relationship.'),
(31,'名字之外的街坊','Neighbors Beyond Names','城门已有安排，街坊希望维护不再每次受继承之争拖累。','Gate arrangements exist; neighbors want maintenance freed from recurring succession disputes.','parley','forge','轮流安排自愿守夜与检查','Arrange voluntary watch and inspection turns','参加者只承担自己同意的班次，不代表整条街都入盟。','Participants take only agreed turns, not bind the entire street to a faction.','缺席时需要通知与替班，街坊关系由真实往来继续。','Absences need notice and replacement; real interactions continue.','教住户维护一个常坏的铰链','Teach residents to maintain a troublesome hinge','几名住户亲手试过维护，不必每次等一位英雄回来。','Residents practice the repair themselves instead of awaiting a hero.','工具归属与材料补充成为下一次普通商议。','Tool ownership and resupply become ordinary future discussions.'),
(38,'灯照到谁家','Whose Homes the Beacon Reaches','灯塔修护或记录已有进展，附近小船户想知道自己能得到什么。','Beacon work has progressed; small boat owners ask how it helps them.','survey','parley','在灯塔岸边测绘实际可见灯区','Survey the beam’s visible reach from the beacon shore','你标出遮挡礁角，灯光并未覆盖所有海面。','You mark an obstructing reef; the beam does not cover every stretch of sea.','船户想补一个普通岸标，不必再造一座古代奇迹。','Crews propose a simple shore marker rather than another ancient miracle.','请守望者说明维护与限制','Ask keepers to explain maintenance and limits','守望者明确哪些天气不能依赖灯光，大家讨论备用办法。','Keepers explain weather limits and discuss alternatives.','理解限制让合作更实在，古灯仍有未解的过去。','Understanding limits grounds cooperation while the beacon’s past remains partly unknown.'),
(40,'愿意回的那封信','The Letter Someone Chose to Answer','寻亲中转已有回应，但当事人未必愿意重返旧家庭。','A mediated search receives an answer, but the person may not want to return.','parley','song','尊重只愿报平安的答复','Respect an answer that offers only reassurance','你传达获准转告的近况，不替对方许诺重逢。','You relay authorized news without promising a reunion.','寻亲者可以失望，也可能慢慢接受，后续不强制和解。','The searcher may grieve or gradually accept; reconciliation is not forced.','陪愿意讲述的人记录现在的生活','Record present life with a willing speaker','被寻者谈起新朋友与工作，不再只是名单上的旧身份。','The person describes new work and friends rather than only a former identity.','是否把记录分享给家人仍由本人决定。','Sharing that account with family remains the speaker’s decision.')]

